  {
   "id": "line006",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_5d01a52563338e00072b8c9c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "冷たい人だったわけではありません。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line007",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_5d01a52563338e00072b8c9c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "借金と暮らしに疲れ果てた母親に残っていたのは、小さな意地だけだったのです。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line008",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_5d01a52563338e00072b8c9c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おんなでひとつで子どもを育てて、三年。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line009",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_5d01a52563338e00072b8c9c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "昼は食堂、夜はスーパーで働いても、冬はいつも、お金が先に底をつきました。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line010",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_5d01a52563338e00072b8c9c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "母親が眠ったあと、男の子がこっそり下りてきました。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
